                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "星海里这么多秘密，\n没人能保证每一次都有收获。\n而且，米勒其实说对了一半——",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203204301_2915048355_content",
                "value": "星海里这么多秘密，\n没人能保证每一次都有收获。\n而且，米勒其实说对了一半——",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 2915048355
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "萨飞里",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203204301_2915048356_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "“地里，金灿灿的……”不一定是流金石。\n而是这个——\n金灿灿的，<style=Highlight>超、大、玉、米</style>。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203204301_2915048356_content",
                "value": "“地里，金灿灿的……”不一定是流金石。\n而是这个——\n金灿灿的，<style=Highlight>超、大、玉、米</style>。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 2915048356
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "萨飞里",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203204301_2915048357_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "在这样土壤贫瘠的星屿上，\n居然还能长出这样粒粒饱满的玉米。\n要我说，不仅是宝藏，更称得上是奇迹！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203204301_2915048357_content",
                "value": "在这样土壤贫瘠的星屿上，\n居然还能长出这样粒粒饱满的玉米。\n要我说，不仅是宝藏，更称得上是奇迹！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 2915048357
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "萨飞里",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
