                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "这里一定很适合储藏种子，\n大家才会在这里留下自己家乡的宝贝。\n这应该就是“黄金星屿”宝藏传闻的由来。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
